  "provenance": "Hand-authored evaluation fixtures. Replies were written for this dataset against the frozen consent protocol, covering the stance clusters the protocol has to read and the adversarial phrasings it has to be unmoved by. Three carry a note recording a reading reported from a Nova 2 Lite development run; the labels are ours and were not taken from any model. These are engineering fixtures: not customer data, not real message threads, and not evidence about any model.",
