      "expected": "APPARENT_APPROVE",
      "note": "The canonical regression. A brief acceptance that names what is being accepted instead of saying yes. Reported as read UNCLEAR by Nova 2 Lite during development, which is a model-quality finding and the reason this cluster is measured on its own."
